crates/vb_runtime/src/shard/transitions.rs|DISCARD-006|owner=velvet-ballistics|expiry=2026-09-30|follow_up=vb-rud5|reason=finish_run and fail_run_state intentionally allow the secondary RunStateStore::insert to fail: the original journal-append error is the surfaced one. Best-effort rollback semantics preserved (RE-010/RE-011 regression coverage remains in drive.rs).
